# This repository versions ONLY the Business English app itself.
#
# The repository root also contains original course materials (Woche_*,
# Prüfungsvorbereitung, test_yourself), private internal analyses
# (ANALYSE_*.md, KNOWLEDGE_MAP.md, PROJECT_REVIEW_001.md,
# DOKUMENTATION_BESTANDSANALYSE.md) and other project-management documents.
# Per PUBLIC_PRIVATE_POLICY.md, original materials and private learning
# artefacts must never be put under version control - not even locally,
# and regardless of whether this repository is ever pushed anywhere.
#
# Rather than trying to list every private file individually (and risking
# a new one slipping through unnoticed), this file default-denies
# everything at the repository root and explicitly allow-lists only the
# application itself.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/vite.config.js
!/index.html
!/.claude
!/src

# Within the allow-listed app folders, still exclude build output,
# dependencies, editor/OS files, and any private local content that might
# be placed there.
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Private local study material (never committed, never bundled)
private/
src/data/private/
